# WhittleGuide — optional configuration. Copy to `.env.local` for local dev.
# The app is fully functional with NONE of these set.

# Europeana provider (optional, disabled by default).
# Get a free key at https://pro.europeana.eu/pages/get-api-keys
# In production, set this as a GitHub Actions repository secret and expose it to
# the build step as VITE_EUROPEANA_KEY (see .github/workflows/deploy.yml).
# VITE_EUROPEANA_KEY=

# Smithsonian Open Access API key (build-time only, for `npm run catalogue -- --enrich`).
# Get one at https://api.data.gov/signup/ . Not needed at runtime.
# SI_API_KEY=
